{"3064060":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Super Chipflake Ü: Quest for the Uncooked Schnitzel","steam_appid":3064060,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some rescue princesses, others save the whole world. But here, you save your rumbling stomach<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3064060\/extras\/fc0e1caca4600cb3f9e8ecff6fce6fa8.poster.avif?t=1785702081\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3064060\/extras\/fc0e1caca4600cb3f9e8ecff6fce6fa8.webm?t=1785702081\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3064060\/extras\/fc0e1caca4600cb3f9e8ecff6fce6fa8.mp4?t=1785702081\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span> <br><br>So don’t wait until hunger takes over. Embark on a quirky journey full of adventures, unexpected encounters, platforming challenges, and a fun combination mechanic. Explore a world packed with mysteries, eccentric characters, and bizarre problems. Dig, swing, and sprint through a lovingly crafted world where surprises await you around every corner!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3064060\/extras\/6671aec91d53e3fdc28cb4af3844045f.poster.avif?t=1785702081\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3064060\/extras\/6671aec91d53e3fdc28cb4af3844045f.webm?t=1785702081\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3064060\/extras\/6671aec91d53e3fdc28cb4af3844045f.mp4?t=1785702081\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><strong>  <\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Schländ<\/strong> - a compact but densely filled land brimming with exciting discoveries and adventures<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet and help the locals<\/strong> - from clueless cats and helpless creatures to a potential lover: they’re all counting on you in their challenges!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merge and create<\/strong> - creatively merge items to overcome obstacles and craft brand-new tools<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your tools <\/strong>- dig up hidden treasures with your shovel, uncover secret spots with the grappling hook, or dash through Schländ at lightning speed with your running shoes.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create the PERFECT schnitzel<\/strong> - if you do everything just right, you’ll be rewarded with a irresistible schnitzel from Schnitzelville’s very own chef!<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3064060\/extras\/e8561b373d1fda4ea1d11066de456c59.poster.avif?t=1785702081\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3064060\/extras\/e8561b373d1fda4ea1d11066de456c59.webm?t=1785702081\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3064060\/extras\/e8561b373d1fda4ea1d11066de456c59.mp4?t=1785702081\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3064060\/extras\/16a7657736e3787e25832982686d6a89.poster.avif?t=1785702081\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https:\